<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN">

<html>
<head>
	<title><CFOUTPUT>#application.CompanyName#</CFOUTPUT> Documentation :: Billbacks :: Entering Billback Information</title>
	<script language="JavaScript">
<!--
function change(html){
  description.innerHTML=html
  description2.innerHTML=html
}
//-->
</script>
</head>

<body>
<strong><div id="description">&nbsp; </div></strong>
<cfinclude template="capture_toc.cfm">
<HR COLOR="Orange">

<div align="center">


<p></p>
<table align="center" width="90%">
<tr><th colspan="2"><strong>Billback Information</strong></th></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td></tr>
 <tr><td valign="top" colspan="2" align="center"><img src="../../images/billback_capture_1.gif"></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2">&nbsp; </td></tr>

<tr><td colspan="2">The <CFOUTPUT>#application.returned_customer_setting.Trade_Label# #Application.PlannerLabel#</CFOUTPUT> helps users plan trade programs for <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural#</cfoutput>. </td></tr>

<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/1.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Billback Code: The billback code is a number generated by the system. </td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/2.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Billback Number: Enter the billback number given by the organization that created the billback (required field).</td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/3.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Billback Title: Enter a name for the billback (required).</td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/4.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Billback Date: You should enter or select the day the billback was generated.  The billback date must be later than the end of the delivery period (required).</td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/5.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Delivery Period: This is the period the billback covers.  You must enter both a start and end date with the end date before the billback date (required). </td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/6.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Amount: The total amount claimed by the billback.  </td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/7.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Notes: Enter notes about the billback.  These are notes which will be available externally.   </td></tr>
<tr><td valign="top"><img src="../../images/8.gif"></td><td valign="top">
Comments: Comments are notes that are available only within the system.  </td></tr>

</table>
<p></p>
</div>


<HR COLOR="Orange">
<strong><div id="description2">&nbsp; </div></strong>
<cfinclude template="capture_toc.cfm">
<cfinclude template="capture_updated.cfm">

</body>
</html>
